 in their own task\n- Decorative elements suggest a celebratory or motivational theme in a tech company\n- Most appear to be of East Asian descent, consistent with a Chinese tech office setting\n\n**Relationship Analysis:**\nThe evidence strongly indicates these individuals are **colleagues**:\n1. They share a professional workspace (open-plan office with desks in a row)\n2. They are engaged in similar computer-based work activities\n3. Their attire is appropriate for a tech company environment\n4. The lack of personal interaction suggests professional rather than personal relationships\n5. The celebratory balloons with motivational text ("Future is Possible") suggest a workplace milestone or company culture\n\nThey are not family (no familial intimacy), not classmates (adults in professional setting, not educational), and not strangers (clearly sharing a workspace with common purpose).\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "FINAL_ANSWER",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_6230.jpg", "frames/frame_6235.jpg", "frames/frame_6240.jpg", "frames/frame_6245.jpg", "frames/frame_6250.jpg", "frames/frame_6255.jpg", "frames/frame_6260.jpg", "frames/frame_6265.jpg", "frames/frame_6270.jpg"],\n    "answer": "2",\n    "reasoning": "At 103:57 (frame_6235.jpg), the scene shows five men working at computers in an open-plan office with celebratory decorations. Their shared workspace, similar work activities, professional but casual attire, lack of personal interaction, and the tech company environment with motivational balloons all indicate they are colleagues working together in a tech company, most likely software engineers or AI developers.",\n    "answer_criteria": [\n        "Individuals are seated together in a shared workspace with desks in close proximity",\n        "All are engaged in similar computer-based work activities typical of tech company employees",\n        "No personal or familial interaction observed - focused on individual work tasks",\n        "Environment includes office eq